1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,176
Let's see who dares stop me... I'm carrying the Jiang family's heir

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,965
That's your grandchild... you'd let it end up out there?

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,859
Cut the act... at your age, how could you even get pregnant?

4
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:20,526
We're at a hospital, why would I lie... Son, please, I'm begging

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,579
I'm already ruined, but this child is the Jiangs' only heir

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,894
In my past life, I was killed by my husband and that whore's affair

7
00:00:28,894 --> 00:00:31,125
This life, your whole family pays in blood

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:37,336
Xiao Lan, come wash my feet... Zhang Guifang

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,287
Don't push it... Oh, my precious son says

10
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,874
he wants Grandma serving him personally. If she doesn't do it well

11
00:00:45,874 --> 00:00:48,659
he won't come out. Stay in there, let's see who cracks first

12
00:00:48,659 --> 00:01:02,900
Honey

13
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,492
Honey, calm down... careful, the baby in her belly

14
00:01:05,492 --> 00:01:15,029
So you spare her only for the Jiang heir in her belly... Keep sweeping. Something's wrong

15
00:01:15,029 --> 00:01:19,221
Very wrong... The look Jiang Chengao gave her wasn't for a daughter-in-law

16
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:24,458
Gently! I'm carrying your child... don't crush it

